'log_MATCH_PATTERN_DESC' => '(en)You may also optionally specify a highlight pattern to mark in bold any lines from the log file which match the highlight pattern. The highlight pattern is applied to any lines which have already matched the filter pattern. Note that this option is not used if you download the logfile.',
